@url=http://localhost:3000

### Calcular Rectangulo
POST {{url}}/rectangulos/calcular
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ancho": 10,
    "alto": 5
}

### Calcular Cuadrado
POST {{url}}/rectangulos/calcular
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ancho": 7,
    "alto": 7
}

### Prueba Validacion
POST {{url}}/rectangulos/calcular
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ancho": 10,
    "alto": -5
}